# NestedText v3 — 10.0.0 Matrix-Cross_OS_Scala-Edge-DtD release plan (from intake, 20 answers)

decisions:
    priority: full-study-nt-first
    nt-layout: per-folder-dtd-plus-per-file-args
    nt-expand: permitted
    gate-shape: ramified-OS-gate-1-linux-gate-2-windows-gate-3-macos
    os-seals: extended-OS-plus-heavy-seals
    model: sonnet-5-tier-default
    deep: both-hadal-and-hadopelagia
    hadopelagia-rounds: uncapped-per-user
    ask-forms: bracket-angle-caret-empty-all-four
    sigil: full-simplify-plus-variants
    skill: tri-polyglot-md-nt-yaml-plus-overhaul-all-old-skills
    env: think-subset-plus-timeout-subset
    read: whole-before-nt
    release: audit-sh-plus-CI-plus-bypass-plus-reverse-gulp-plus-readme
    preview: audit-all-with-cube
    depth: schematic-plus-brackets-plus-NT38-map-plus-YAML-mix
    secrets: sealed-rotation-blind-run
    timeouts: per-job-ceiling-plus-cache-timer-60m

matrix-command:
    name: git-gh-matrix-scala-dtd
    delivers: finished-gate.yml-tested
    targets:
        - app
        - program
        - project
        - claude-code-repo
        - folder
    choices:
        - seals-count
        - os-count-versions
        - ceiling-timeout-per-job
        - node-latest-checker
        - single-vs-ramified-vs-matrix-vs-manual
        - model-effort-thinking-5-tier
        - env-tiers-from-LZ-BINARY
        - cache-timer-60m-retrigger-count
    thinking-table:
        > MAX_THINKING_TOKENS unset = adaptive; 0 = disabled; >0 = enabled budget.
        > Clamp: min(budget, max_tokens-1); max_tokens via CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS (64000 opus-5 default, 128000 upper).
        > Percent-of-128k: 5%=6400, 10%=12800, 25%=32000, 50%=64000, 100%=127999.
        > Effort low/med/high allow thinking-off (0); xhigh/max use low nonzero (25%=16384) to avoid overthinking.

companions:
    - git-gh-companion-dtd-scala-capable-nt-gulp-reverse
    - companions-gate-dtd-bypassPermissions-for-family
    - git-gh-family-update-long-unupdated

release-gate:
    > audit companion .sh installed on machine, published to ORG repo, CI green, version computed never typed.
